{"resourceIdentifier":"3140","resourceName":"ZhaoQu Afforestation Project","description":"ZhaoQu Afforestation Project (hereafter refer to as “the project”) is located within Zhaotong City and Qujing City, Yunan Province of China. It is an inland province, bordering Guizhou to the eest, Sichuan to the northwest. The province has a total population of 46.9 million. The project aims to plant native species on suitable land for forest  for GHG removal whilst contributing to local sustainable development goals.\r\n36,607 ha (549,105 Mu ) of forest was planted on suitable land for forest in Zhaotong City and Qujing City which used to be poor sustainable ecological environment and karst rocky desertification. Prior to the project, the project area was suitable land for forest, there is no forestry management and the coverage by planting trees is low, and there has never been any activity affecting the local ecosystem . By checking the afforestation plan with the forestry bureau of Zhaotong City and Qujing City, it was confirmed that, a small number of trees have been planted in some project area before the project started, but the coverage by planting trees is low. So considering the low forest coverage, the forestry bureau of Zhaotong City and Qujing City determined that the project area is suitable for afforestation after investigation, then the local forestry bureau approved the supplementary planting without disturbing the existing trees in January 2019 to increase the vegetative cover.","location":{"latitude":26.899999,"longitude":103.750000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-03","endExclusive":"2023-03-06","endInclusive":"2023-03-05"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3140"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yunnan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yunnan Ruihan Agricultural Technology Development Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Yunnan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 1868500649"},{"type":"string","value":"yunnanruihan@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"577730"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR; REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"36607 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/09/2019 - 14/09/2049"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yunnan Ruihan Agricultural Technology Development Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Yunnan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 1868500649"},{"type":"string","value":"yunnanruihan@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Project withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"577730"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Afforestation, Reforestation and Revegetation"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"36607 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"CCB_STANDARD_EDITION_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CCB Third Edition"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=65767&IDKEY=nq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulk